Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Infuriating...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Absolutely vexing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.17,0:00:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're covered in dirt!\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Moreover, where are all the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those damned incompetents!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why do I bother giving them such\Nhigh-caliber weaponry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,if they can't even use it properly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.13,0:00:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What in the world could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-this can't be real...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the Dragon of Calamity...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.25,0:00:59.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.46,0:01:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Brionac should have killed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It got resurrected?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That sort of thing\Nshouldn't be possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But they have that one bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,A diabolical man that can use\Nhealing magic far beyond anyone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.75,0:01:17.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, even if he did heal it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's impossible for them\Nto just sic that dragon on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which means someone is controlling it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Demonfolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where is that man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That one beast tamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:35.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you mean Master Lude?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's already left for Sarenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems there's urgent business\Nthat requires his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That damned sly dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Changed sides, has he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you detain him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty, you told us\Nto give him special treatment, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please compose yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop\Nstanding around like an ass
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:01:58.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,and come up with a plan to fix this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damned good-for-nothings!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get the device ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Which device do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Keraunos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keraunos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-with all due respect,\Nthat weapon is still in the testing stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The power output remains too high,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the sights haven't finished\Nbeing properly aligned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,On top of that,\Nit's dangerous to use in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.42,0:02:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You pathetic fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you not see the disaster\Nthat's right in front of your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but, even so, the possibility of\Ncollateral damage is very real-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We just need one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all it will take to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you can't aim it properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,then just implement Mana Tracing\Non the gun barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty, as you command!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pitiful dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow you away\Nwithout a single trace this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:56.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Acquiring target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Direction: 1120.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Angle of fire: 40 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mana tracing applied.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest technological\Nwonder in the empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,developed under the wise leadership\Nof Deridas the Third:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The light of judgement!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The trajectory of Keraunos changed\Nand now it's raining down on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What could have caused that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-because it was set to trace mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our mana furnaces\Nhave become its new target!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who authorized using that setting?!\NYou imbeciles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're all done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh! I can't deal with\Nthis mess any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're in charge of handling the rest!\NThat's an order from your direct superior!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You, Aide, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's an order\Nfrom your direct superior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been a pleasure, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:05.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll have your heads for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't hit those...\NAnywhere but those!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-make it stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I've lost track of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to seek out his location,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it's as if there's a thick wall\Npreventing me from doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he took refuge\Nin a building made of mana metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:13.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something's heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's magnitudes stronger\Nthan that light from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's not enough time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were the one who ordered me to come up\Nwith a way to fix this, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must realize this is treason\Nagainst the crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it's also the only way we can ensure\Nthe empire survives!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:09.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-help! Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,There is no one here\Nwho is still willing to obey you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Say your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Phew. What a stroke of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm? The sparkly gold old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:34.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to protect this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then stay out of our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what's happening,\Nbut calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Old man, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are you attacking me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This guy's a skilled bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We all have to charge him together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:07:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't see any other way\Nto interpret this situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That man has brought irreparable harm\Nupon our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And he must atone for it with his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,but can't you just talk this out or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Were that possible,\Nwe'd have done it long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that a bomb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you ganging up on him like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's just an old man, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're the one\Nwho sent him flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:33.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, isn't this guy supposed\Nto be your emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't make heads or tails\Nof this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't need to understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:46.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cut it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you just trying to kill him yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's old enough to kick\Nthe bucket any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why not let nature take its course?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because we don't have\Na single moment to spare!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:01.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The enemy is already\Ninvading our territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they've got that\NDragon of Calamity in tow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Invading?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's precisely why we need to show them\Nwe have no intention of fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our country is doomed\Nunless we offer them this man's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's for our survival!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We appreciate your thoughtfulness,\Nbut there will be no need for all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dead men cannot atone\Nfor their crimes, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys made it. What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor, I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die,\Nbut I got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are these people who I think they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you let us take care\Nof everything from here on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, I think the safest way to handle this\Nis to negotiate rather than fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't seem like\Nthey'll listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne, could you go with Sir Noor\Nand tend to his wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Instructor Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good luck sorting this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since our\Nlast encounter, Circuit of Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Prince Rein...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please lower your swords, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Before anything else,\Nwe'd like to talk to that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:18.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Help... Spare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Spare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:22.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that you want forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I intend to forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-really? Then I-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are currently 23 people\Nin our nation who have gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:37.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nineteen people have been buried\Nunder crumbling homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thirteen people that have\Nburned to death in fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight people\Ninjured by falling debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,the people who were torn apart, crushed,\Nand reduced to mangled pieces of flesh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,by the beasts you\Nunleashed in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are 127 of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the total number of casualties\Nin my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Although, I'm sure there are more\Nwe don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just as I said earlier,\NI will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is, only if you're willing to\Nexperience the same amount of suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,as all those I just mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once that's finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would like to hold a multinational talk\Nabout reparations and ending the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do I hear any objections to this proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,No objections!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:27.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What in the world do you mean by...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,the same amount of suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll experience the same,\Nbut you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if we break off your legs\Nand crush your innards,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I shall make sure you are\Nhealed enough by the end
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,to at least participate in the talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if you can't tolerate the suffering\Nand you lose consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:54.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you can cry and scream\Nas much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:11:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,P-please, spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We aren't doing this\Nbecause we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What we want is for you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,to thoroughly understand\Nthe pain you put our people through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:18.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all it's going to cost you\Nfor forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:24.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our nation is incredibly merciful...\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear that, Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,All this damage...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:44.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did that light from earlier cause it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The powerful mana beam\Nthat you deflected got split,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and rained down on the imperial capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn. I did something awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You did it to protect us, Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That may be true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone must have died, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the facilities that got destroyed\Nwere all mana furnaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mana furnaces?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those areas have a very high\Nconcentration with mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,so people can't even enter them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course, it will affect the lives\Nof the citizens here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but not as much as the people\Nof our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then it's all over now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,From here on, both our countries\Nare moving towards
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,coordinating post-war reconstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The war barely started\Nand now it's already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I don't get why we just\Ndidn't talk it out from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, what about the old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He chose to abdicate the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it's likely his grandchild\Nwill be chosen to inherit the crown next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,His grandchild, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're only 10 years old at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which means that a guardian\Nhas to be appointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It will be the Circuit of Ten\Nyou met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those ten guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor? Do I have your name right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd like to apologize for\Nmisunderstanding the situation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,and turning our blades on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will do whatever it takes\Nto make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not really worried about it,\Nso you don't need to make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,More importantly, you need to reconsider\Nyour morals if you think it's okay
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,to gang up on the elderly like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, I know it is something\NI should be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Had you not been there to stop us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,our empire would have ended up\Nin a very nasty civil war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd like to thank you, wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I really don't deserve your thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's more like I was the one\Nwho got saved, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought I was done for\Nwhen I leapt off the dragon's back,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but luckily, you guys had a floor\Nfor me to land safely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lucky to land safely on the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You truly are an amusing man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's leave it at that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But don't forget:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,In the future, we will spare\Nno expense to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So if you ever need our help, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:22.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We will risk our lives\Nto come to your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I'm sorry I damaged\Nyour city so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.25,0:15:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no need\Nto concern yourself with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,As of right now,\Nthere are no reports of dead or injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,The crimes of our country,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,which threw away the treaty\Nand attacked your nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,are far more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But tell me if there's anything\NI can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:51.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can at least help get rid of the rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're a good-hearted person,\Nalmost to a fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It says it's bored and wants to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, please excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,From here on out,\Nwe'll correspond through messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, please return home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,My apologies for not giving my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am the imperial sorcerer Randeus,\Nof the Circuit of Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:25.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ran... Randeus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:29.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I do look forward\Nto seeing you again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll see ya around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. We're taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo, will you ask it something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,On the way home,\Ncan we fly closer to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can tell he's deeply concerned\Nabout the damage done to this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a compassionate person he is.\NI must learn from his example!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've all returned safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The war is now over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you do\Nall the negotiating, Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can fill me in on the details later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Before that, I must extend thanks\Nto our savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor made incredible\Ncontributions on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He needs a reward worthy of his deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Reward? No, I don't want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm flattered, but I'm not really\Nin need of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't just refuse this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to provide you\Nwith a proper reward,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,or else it will set a bad example.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, this family really\Nwants to push stuff on you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,even if you say\Nyou don't want anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually, there is one thing\NI want to ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-oh? Ah, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.67,0:18:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, just name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I would like you\Nto help this kid out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, what? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This child is demonfolk, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems he doesn't have anyone to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since he was abandoned\Nby a group of merchants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then what is your request?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want you to let him live in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And provide him with a normal life,\Njust like all the other citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I considered us living together,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it's better for him to be looked after\Nby a rich family,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,and not someone with\Nan unsteady income, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You said you'd give me a house\Nand land before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something like that would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And some clothes and food\Nwould be good, if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But for that to happen, this boy will\Nneed to become a citizen of this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:18:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's saved me countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The only reason that huge dragon\Ndid what I said was because he was with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it was because you-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No need to be humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Rolo weren't there, the war wouldn't\Nhave ended so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of all the things he could ask for...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.83,0:19:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Holy Theocracy of Mithra\Nregards the demonfolk as enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,which means accepting one in our kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,will cause a rift in\Nthe relations between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just so you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything aside from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you want to give me other rewards,\Nthen spend them elsewhere instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,There is no shortage of people\Nwho've lost their homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.67,0:19:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's really
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,where you should be focusing\Nall your resources on right now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact,\Nyou're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:20:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,This guy really likes to laugh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I'm reborn, I hope I won't\Nget beaten so badly in my next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be at least\Na little bit useful to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I hope I can have something\Ndelicious to eat, at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,For the time being,\Nyou will be living here together with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, welcome home, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They prepared a nice meal for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it'll get cold\Nif you don't hurry and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.83,0:21:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is our dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or is there something here\Nyou don't like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is... real food?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come now, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one will be angry with you\Nno matter what you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the... food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's... soft?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's... delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Slow down, no one will\Ntake it from you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:04.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:11.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,#11 I Parry Divine Wrath
